        purchase_to_pay_prompt_description: "Design a BPMN 2.0 diagram for a standard Purchase to Pay business process. Include the key steps from purchase requisition through approval, creating and sending a purchase order to the supplier, goods receipt, performing a quality check on the goods, returning the goods to the supplier if it fails the quality check, and processing the invoice to final payment if it passes the quality check. Focus on the main process flow without unnecessary complexity.",
